14406	RISK-1199	A0972_Gipiškis2024	Release strategy disagreement between developers	Governance Disclosure	Developers of restricted-access models with similar capabilities may disagree about the strategy or precautions to take for model release, especially in the case of competitive pressure or minimal safety regulation oversight. In such a case, if only a single developer releases an equally capable model unrestricted, malicious actors can use it instead of restricted-access alternatives [88].
10851	RISK-1199	A0019_Bengio2025	Safety of The Intended Function	Model Safety Engineering	An approach that requires engineers to provide evidence that a system is safe when operating as intended.This approach is used in many engineering fields, such as in the construction and testing of road vehicles.
