11378	RISK-214	A0923_UK Government2023	Data Audits for AI System Behavior	Testing & Auditing	Use data audits to improve understanding of how training data affects AI system behaviour. For example, if model evaluations reveal a potentially dangerous capability, data audits can help ascertain the extent to which the training data contributed to it.
