7148	RISK-239	A0971_Gipiškis2024	Restricted usage terms for open-source models	Access Management	Developers of open-weights and open-source AI models can vet and restrict the users of their AI systems by requiring them to sign a Terms of Service agreement before getting access to the model weights. Such agreements can include limitations to the usage, modification, and proliferation of the AI model [88].Such agreements have the advantage that users only need to be vetted once before getting model access, but are often limited in practice in preventing unauthorised use or distribution.
