1905	RISK-682	A1012_Gipiškis2024	Using an AI model to evaluate AI model outputs	Testing & Auditing	In cases where the outputs of AI models cannot be easily evaluated, AI mod- els can be used to evaluate their outputs or the outputs of other AI models [82, 16, 17, 91]. The evaluations can then provide a training signal to improve the original model’s performance or offer explanations of the output for human users.
