3212	RISK-683	A0909_UK Government2023	Diverse Monitoring Techniques	Post-deployment Monitoring	Employ diverse monitoring techniques to balance comprehensiveness, scalability, and privacy. A strong monitoring setup will generally combine automated and human review, in recognition that automated reviews may miss intricate issues, while human reviews are not always scalable and can pose privacy issues.
