3424	RISK-90	A0804_UK Government2023	Development and testing of Model Evaluation Methods	Testing & Auditing	Support the development and testing of model evaluation methods. For many relevant properties of models, there do not yet exist accepted evaluation methods. It also remains unclear how reliable or predictive current evaluation methods are. This could involve frontier AI organisations developing model evaluation methods themselves or facilitating the efforts of others, such as by providing access to capable infrastructure for evaluation.
3423	RISK-90	A0955_Gipiškis2024	Benchmarks for Situational Awareness	Testing & Auditing	A model is situationally aware if it internally represents that it is a machine learning model and if it can accurately infer or act on model-relevant facts - e.g., if it is currently in training, testing, evaluation or deployment, or the desired outcome of an evaluation. Some benchmarks exist for situational awareness of AI models, which test whether the AI models can classify stereotypical inputs from training, test- ing, evaluation and deployment as such, and whether the AI model can use this information correctly to take actions in the world [25, 111].
